{"id":8859735326919,"title":"Personalized Colorful Tree of Life Quilts, Yggdrasil Quilt King","handle":"personalized-colorful-tree-of-life-quilts-yggdrasil-quilt-king","description":"\u003cp\u003eEmbrace the symbolic beauty of the Tree of Life with this personalized quilt set from Jeminise. Perfect for adding a touch of meaningful elegance to any bedroom, this versatile bedding also makes an ideal gift for housewarmings, weddings, or any special occasion, offering comfort and style in one thoughtful package.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAmazing Yggdrasil Quilt Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features the iconic Tree of Life, symbolizing resilience, strength, and interconnectedness.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Choose from Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), or King (91x102 inches) to perfectly fit your needs.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eThoughtful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e An excellent choice for loved ones, including mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter, or any cherished individual.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e This set includes 1 quilt, with an optional pillowcase for a complete look.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washable in cold water and can be air-dried without heat, ensuring quick drying and lasting fluffiness.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Functional and decorative for use on a bed, as a cozy wrap while relaxing, or for indoor and outdoor activities like camping and picnics.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePersonalization Options:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features a text input option, allowing for a personalized touch.\u003c\/li\u0